      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "body",
      "narration_text": "Of all the A I fluency skills, this is the one people underrate. Not tricks, not magic words. Description. Telling the machine what the product is, how it should be made, and how it should sound. Brutalist makes you write all three down.",
